{"1642060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Broken Spectre", "steam_appid": 1642060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/72cd0a9804329979a0a70f1dd51305b5.poster.avif?t=1761055152\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/72cd0a9804329979a0a70f1dd51305b5.webm?t=1761055152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/72cd0a9804329979a0a70f1dd51305b5.mp4?t=1761055152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: This game has only been tested for Meta Quest VR Headsets. Additional headsets may support this game but are untested.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 years ago your father climbed the mountain and never came back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now he’s calling for you with updated graphics, smoother interactions, and quality of life upgrades in the <strong>Director’s Cut</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A winner of 6 awards and 11 other nominations and selections, <strong>Broken Spectre</strong> is an eldritch horror narrative game developed in collaboration with one of the makers of <i>The Blair Witch Project</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/c5dbb44fffc56f1286b70d0f76d7bf4d.poster.avif?t=1761055152\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/c5dbb44fffc56f1286b70d0f76d7bf4d.webm?t=1761055152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casey’s dark journey begins when she receives a cryptic message from her father, which leads her back to the abandoned trails of Coldblood Mountain, a remote wilderness that has haunted her family for generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stalking her is a terrible power, watching Casey’s every move, and forcing her to make horrific decisions in the hopes of finding her lost father. Can you help her solve the clues he left littered behind on the mountain’s cold, uncaring slopes? Or will something else find her first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/dd156d63536c2910502ece037dcc87c4.poster.avif?t=1761055152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/dd156d63536c2910502ece037dcc87c4.webm?t=1761055152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Eldritch Horror Narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produced by one of the creators of <i>The Blair Witch Project</i> – a landmark of the found-footage horror genre - <strong>Broken Spectre</strong> is an original eldritch horror experience inspired by the works of John Carpenter and H.P. Lovecraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/72cd0a9804329979a0a70f1dd51305b5.poster.avif?t=1761055152\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/72cd0a9804329979a0a70f1dd51305b5.webm?t=1761055152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/72cd0a9804329979a0a70f1dd51305b5.mp4?t=1761055152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: This game has only been tested for Meta Quest VR Headsets. Additional headsets may support this game but are untested.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 years ago your father climbed the mountain and never came back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now he’s calling for you with updated graphics, smoother interactions, and quality of life upgrades in the <strong>Director’s Cut</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A winner of 6 awards and 11 other nominations and selections, <strong>Broken Spectre</strong> is an eldritch horror narrative game developed in collaboration with one of the makers of <i>The Blair Witch Project</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/c5dbb44fffc56f1286b70d0f76d7bf4d.poster.avif?t=1761055152\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/c5dbb44fffc56f1286b70d0f76d7bf4d.webm?t=1761055152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casey’s dark journey begins when she receives a cryptic message from her father, which leads her back to the abandoned trails of Coldblood Mountain, a remote wilderness that has haunted her family for generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stalking her is a terrible power, watching Casey’s every move, and forcing her to make horrific decisions in the hopes of finding her lost father. Can you help her solve the clues he left littered behind on the mountain’s cold, uncaring slopes? Or will something else find her first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/dd156d63536c2910502ece037dcc87c4.poster.avif?t=1761055152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/extras/dd156d63536c2910502ece037dcc87c4.webm?t=1761055152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Eldritch Horror Narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produced by one of the creators of <i>The Blair Witch Project</i> – a landmark of the found-footage horror genre - <strong>Broken Spectre</strong> is an original eldritch horror experience inspired by the works of John Carpenter and H.P. Lovecraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "25 years ago your father climbed the mountain and never came back. Now he’s calling for you. Experience the award winning, narrative eldritch horror game like you haven’t before in the Director’s Cut. Can you unravel the mystery of your father who disappeared in the remote wilderness years ago?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, German, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“For fans of VR horror seeking an immersive and narrative-driven experience, &quot;Broken Spectre&quot; shouldn't be missed. It breaks free from the shackles of traditional horror titles that rely on jump-scare and offers a far more profound and interactive VR experience. Cosmic horror and dread permeate every moment, and the game's innovative hand-tracking system amplifies the sense of presence and agency. With its generous allowance for player exploration and the absence of VR sickness, Broken Spectre pushes the boundaries of virtual reality horror, setting a new standard for the genre.”<br>9/10 – SVG<br><br>“If you’re a fan of VR horror and have a Quest 2, Broken Spectre is an experience you won’t want to pass up. It’s not your typical jump-scare fest and requires a lot more interaction and exploration, but the reward is a much more satisfying experience that’s worth your time and attempts to move the genre forward in its own way.”<br>9/10 – Rely on Horror<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/b82025fe10aa0dba9c54e7f7dc64399d9bfab531/header.jpg?t=1761055152", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/ec30b5f7c55f58cfe6ddcd9612df1d1023c975b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761055152", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/ec30b5f7c55f58cfe6ddcd9612df1d1023c975b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761055152", "website": "https://brokenspectre.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 64-bit versions only<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD Radeon R9 290<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 900 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Oculus devices only</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</s